# Sentry project DSN for error reporting in the browser. Optional: without it nothing is sent.
# A DSN is public by design (it ends up in the bundle); use a separate Sentry project from the server's.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=""
# Where it runs, e.g. production or staging; built into the bundle. Blank: Vite's mode.
VITE_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=""
